    ],
    "coreTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "派派在[强化特殊技：引擎转]或[终结技]中发动旋转斩击命中敌人时，获得1层[动力]，最多叠加20层，持续12秒，重复触发时刷新持续时间；每拥有一层[动力]，派派的物理异常积蓄效率提升4%。"
    },
    "additionalAbilityTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "队伍中存在与自身属性或阵营相同的角色时触发：\n派派拥有20层或以上[动力]时，全队角色造成的伤害提升18%。"
    },
    "cinemaTexts": [
      {
        "en": "When Piper's Special Attack: Tire Spin, EX Special Attack: Engine Spin, or Ultimate hits an enemy with a spinning slash, there is a 50% chance to gain an additional stack of Power. The maximum stack limit of Power is increased to 30.",
        "zh-CN": "派派在[特殊技：轮胎转]、[强化特殊技：引擎转]或[终结技]中发动旋转斩击命中敌人时，有50%概率额外获得1层[动力]，[动力]的叠加层数上限提升至30层。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During Special Attack: Tire Spin and EX Special Attack: Engine Spin, Piper's movement speed increases. When using Special Attack: One Trillion Tons, EX Special Attack: Really Heavy, or Ultimate to launch a downward smash that hits an enemy, the Physical DMG dealt by the move is increased by 10%. For each stack of Power, this buff is further increased by 1%.",
        "zh-CN": "在[特殊技：轮胎转]和[强化特殊技：引擎转]发动期间，派派的移动速度有所提升；在[特殊技：有亿点重]、[强化特殊技：非常重]和[终结技]中发动下砸攻击命中敌人时，招式造成的物理伤害提升10%，每拥有1层[动力]，该增益效果额外提升1%。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "Whenever a squad member inflicts an Attribute Anomaly on an enemy, Piper recovers 20 Energy. This effect can trigger once every 30s.",
        "zh-CN": "队伍中任意角色对敌人施加属性异常效果时，派派回复20点能量，30秒内最多触发一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "Increases the duration limit of EX Special Attack: Engine Spin by 2s and extends the duration of Power by 4s.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技：引擎转]的持续时间上限提升2秒，[动力]的持续时间提升4秒。"
      }
    ]
  }
}